# {{ project_name }}

pnpm + Turbo monorepo: NestJS API (modular monolith, kernel + catalog entries installed
via `pnpm platform module add`) and headless React/Vite front, generated from
`platform-template` (version in `.copier-answers.yml`).

## Getting started

```
cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env
docker compose up -d
pnpm install
pnpm --filter api db:migrate:run
pnpm --filter api db:bootstrap
pnpm dev
```

Front at `http://localhost:5173`, API at `http://localhost:3000` (Scalar at `/docs`).

## Map

- `AGENTS.md` — mandatory-reading rules and tripwires (it is also `CLAUDE.md`).
- `docs/dev/template.md` — what is platform, what is product, how to update, module
  catalog, advisories.
- `docs/catalog/catalog.md` — how a catalog entry works.
- `docs/arch/back.md`, `docs/arch/front.md`, `docs/test/testing.md` — handbooks.
- `docs/dev/deploy.md`, `docs/agents/infra.md` — deploy and infra.
